        "payload": "tree 964b488a662e7be932370d406c6513149cd7384f\nparent 2238f94edeb3ee54289efa5a994a58695ec5b9ef\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1779746650 -0500\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1779746650 -0500\n\nPortal the Send-recipient dropdown out of the dialog body\n\nThe recipient picker rendered its results inside an absolute-positioned\ndiv nested under DialogContent's overflow-hidden + the body wrapper's\noverflow-y-auto, so longer result lists got clipped at the dialog's\nbottom edge.\n\nSwitch the dropdown to a Radix Popover anchored to the input, portalled\ninto DialogContent via PortalContainerProvider (mirrors the pattern in\nThemeSelector). DialogContent is now overflow-visible so the popover can\nextend past it, while the body wrapper carries max-h-[calc(95vh-3rem)]\nto keep the dialog itself bounded and scrollable. The popover stays\ninside the dialog's RemoveScroll boundary so touch-scroll inside the\nresults list still works on mobile.\n\nAlso export PopoverAnchor from the wrapped popover module so picker-style\ncombobox patterns can anchor a popover to a custom element.\n",
